    {
     "kind": "steps",
     "step": "method",
     "title": "2/5 × (3/7 + 4/3)",
     "steps": [
      "Distribute: 2/5 × (3/7 + 4/3) = 2/5 × 3/7 + 2/5 × 4/3.",
      "2/5 × 3/7 = (2 × 3)/(5 × 7) = 6/35.",
      "2/5 × 4/3 = (2 × 4)/(5 × 3) = 8/15.",
      "Now add 6/35 + 8/15. The LCM of 35 and 15 is 105.",
      "6/35 = (6 × 3)/(35 × 3) = 18/105, because 105 ÷ 35 = 3.",
      "8/15 = (8 × 7)/(15 × 7) = 56/105, because 105 ÷ 15 = 7.",
      "18/105 + 56/105 = 74/105."
     ],
     "id": "g8.maths.u1.s1-3-3.20",
